  "LANCTL.UI.BLOCK.LANCTL_INTERACTIVE_CLI_CONTEXT_COMMANDS_SELECT_ELEMENT_SELECT_AN_ELEMENT_BY_IP_MAC_ALIAS_OR_NAM": "LANCTL interactive CLI\n\nContext commands:\n  select ELEMENT       Select an element by IP, MAC, alias or name.\n  info | selected      Show selected element information.\n  deselect             Clear the current selection.\n  clear | cls          Clear the screen and preserve context.\n  history              Show commands entered during the session.\n  version              Show the LANCTL version.\n  help [COMMAND]       Show general or command help.\n  exit                 Close the CLI.\n\nYou can chain commands with ; when the advanced option is enabled:\n  select JL1 ; element -cnf O ; info\n\nWhen an element is selected, you can omit it, for example:\n  select SW\n  element\n  scan --ports 22,80,443\n  ssh probe\n  switch port list\n",
